  "notes": {
    "raw": "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 9 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\mathrm{Cp} ^ {\\circ} = 2 8. 1 5 2 + 4. 3 1 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 3. 8 4 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {5} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 2} \\\\ & \\mathrm{H} ^ {\\circ} - \\mathrm{H} _ {2 9 8} ^ {\\circ} = 2 8. 1 5 2 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 2. 1 5 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3. 8 4 6 \\times 1 0 ^ {2} \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} - 9. 8 7 5 \\end{array}\n$$\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n$$\n\\begin{array}{l l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 9 0 0 \\mathrm{K}: & \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 2 0 4. 4 9 4 + 6. 4 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} - 1. 7 7 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 3 1 6. 9 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ & \\Delta \\mathrm{Gr} ^ {\\circ} = - 2 0 4. 4 9 4 - 6. 4 5 3 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 1. 7 7 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 1 5 8. 4 7 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 1 1 1. 3 2 9 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\end{array}\n$$\nSource: Data from Ferrante (36). ",
